{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04773","headline":"南中送北使二首 二 · 张说","name":"南中送北使二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"待罪居重译，穷愁暮雨秋。\n山临鬼门路，城绕瘴江流。\n人事今如此，生涯尚可求。\n逢君入乡县，传我念京周。\n别恨归途远，离言暮景遒。\n夷歌翻下泪，芦酒未消愁。\n闻有胡兵急，深怀汉国羞。\n和亲先是诈，款塞果爲讐。\n释系应分爵，蠲徒几复侯。\n廉颇诚未老，孙叔宜无谋。\n若道冯唐事，皇恩尚可收。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}